2 TITL Anne Greensleet (Averill)
1 _OID 00b6f870-37ad-4d48-9af0-7389c87edd5a
1 DATE 1668 - 1737
1 PLAC Burial: Unknown, likely: Topsfield MA
1 _DSCR Birth: 	unknown
2 CONT Death: 	unknown
2 CONT 
2 CONT Anne's last name had various spellings in the records including Greensled, Greenslit, and Greenslade. In an Avery Family History it was surmised that she was the granddaughter of Thomas Greenslade and his wife Anna of Salem MA. The wife, who marrie
2 CONC d 2nd to Jacob Pudeator, was hanged as a witch on 9/22/1692 in Salem MA. 
2 CONT 
2 CONT The only suggestion I could find for Anne's parents were John Greenslade, the son of the above Thomas & Anna, and Abigail Curtis.
2 CONT 
2 CONT Anne was born circa 1683, perhaps in Topsfield MA, and was living in Topsfield MA in 1738. 
2 CONT  
2 CONT Family links: 
2 CONT  Spouse:
2 CONT   John Averill (1666 - 1720)
2 CONT  
2 CONT  Children:
2 CONT   John Averill (1711 - 1797)*
2 CONT  
2 CONT *Calculated relationship
2 CONT  
2 CONT Burial:
2 CONT Unknown
2 CONT Specifically: Unknown
2 CONT  
2 CONT Edit Virtual Cemetery info [?]
2 CONT  
2 CONT Created by: Ed Poulin
