2 TITL 1890 New York Police Census
1 _OID 9cc6a14b-41e1-44a7-9010-a5b2e079cdea
1 _DSCR This is from Sep/Oct 1890. It is a secondary census NYC ordered because it did not like the official US Census numbers. Since that federal census was lost this police census is a great substitute. This is 524 West 37th Street and the John and Bridg
2 CONC et Rogan family. It appears that the data does not reflect who actually lived there at the time because several of the daughters were married and are not listed as such. John Rogan and his new bride Sarah Ann English Rogan are not listed together
2 CONC . He is there nut no wife. She is not listed with her parents. They were married earlier that spring at St Raphael. In 1891 their daughter Frances was born. She died in 1893 at 524 West 37th Street which I believe is also the home of the English fa
2 CONC mily.
